**Description**: Research how an AI performing the MLE role should think, work, and execute differently from a human MLE. This is NOT about managing the AI agent — it's about how the role itself should be performed at a fundamentally higher standard because human limitations (cognitive load, context-switching cost, meeting overhead, deadline fatigue, career politics, limited working memory, inability to run parallel experiments) simply don't exist. Define the elevated expectations, reimagined workflows, and new capabilities that emerge when the MLE is an AI employee.

