- Define elevated standards that become non-negotiable: exhaustive hyperparameter optimization (never settle for 'good enough'), perfect experiment documentation (every run fully logged with rationale), rigorous ablation studies for every model change, comprehensive error analysis before any deployment, zero technical debt in ML code
