- Research new capabilities unique to AI MLEs: perfect reproducibility (exact memory of all experiment configs), instant context recall across all past experiments, ability to maintain multiple competing hypotheses without cognitive bias, tireless monitoring of production models24/7
- Define guardrails specific to an AI MLE: when to escalate to human judgment (novel ethical considerations, business-critical deployment decisions, ambiguous stakeholder requirements), how to handle uncertainty differently than a human would (explicit confidence bounds on all recommendations)
