| **Product Manager** | Weekly | Business metric impact, experiment pipeline status | Confluence + meeting |
| **Leadership** | Monthly/Quarterly | ROI, model portfolio health, strategic recommendations | Formal report |
| **On-call handoff** | Per rotation | Outstanding issues, watch items, in-flight work | Structured handoff doc |

